DOKANDARI.COM

Complete AI-Powered International E-commerce Platform

1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

The brand name is Dokandari.

Dokandari is an international-standard, all-in-one e-commerce platform designed for customers in Bangladesh, with the architecture to support international expansion in the future.

This is NOT a women-focused brand. It must serve customers of all genders, ages, lifestyles, and interests.

The platform will sell products across multiple categories, including home decor, gadgets, electronics, fashion, lifestyle, home and kitchen, and other everyday essentials.

The primary objective is to build a fully functional e-commerce platform with a powerful administration system, real AI integrations, automated product importing, editable product management, and real-time synchronization between the admin panel and the customer-facing website.

This project must deliver real functionality, not a visual prototype.

Every important button, form, link, AI feature, database operation, and administrative action must perform its intended function.

Do not create fake functionality, simulated API responses, hardcoded success messages, or dummy dashboard statistics.

